eference करें, पर aggregate और statistical planning 27-task composition पर anchored रहे। MCQ scoring = accuracy on canonical choice letter; free-form scoring = canonicalized prediction vs gold (lowercase + strip-whitespace + arithmetic numeric extraction — assumed-because BBH canonical protocol; document करें कि यह design assumption है, source-paper confirmation pending)। Lock 2: Backbone — SINGLE fixed backbone across both arms, matched-family नहीं। Choice: MinED paper में reported canonical backbone नामांकित करें (documented-prior से plausible candidate 'text-davinci-002 class या open-source equivalent'; exact identity 'MinED-paper-canonical, name TBD pending source-paper confirmation' openly flag करें)। Backbone को experimental-design dimension पर चलने दें, NOT variability dimension पर। Lock 3: Demonstration protocol — PRIMARY = BBH few-shot CoT (Suzgun et al. canonical), greedy decoding, identical prompt-string across EM और MinED arms। Optional secondary robustness = zero-shot CoT (Kojima et al.); इसे appendix में रखें, main analysis few-shot पर anchored रहे। Single seed = 1, multi-seed = 3 seeds (locked; report mean across seeds per arm per task)। Lock 4: Statistical plan — Primary pre-registered metric = global macro-mean accuracy over the 27 tasks (paired per-task vector = 27 differences MinED_i − EM_i)। Secondary metrics = MCQ-only macro-mean, free-form-only macro-mean। Primary test = paired Wilcoxon signed-rank, two-sided, α = 0.05। Per-task headline scores exploratory status में रहेंगे (multiple-comparison caveat carry करें)। Effect size: rank-biserial correlation with 95% bootstrap CI over seeds। Honest small-N caveat (N=27 pairs → structurally low statistical power) result-stage में explicit रहे। Lock 5: MinED implementation slots — design-level defaults (आपको source-paper से confirm करना है, पर ये reasonable MinED prescriptions के साथ consistent हैं): (i) edit-distance level = character-level primary, BPE-level acceptable secondary; (ii) normalization =